Revision history for Module-Starter-Protobuf

0.07    2026-11-23
    - Enhanced generated client METHODS POD with per-method Perl call snippets, Request/Returns L<> links, and typed Parameter L<> links for message/enum fields.
    - Added POD documentation to lib/Module/Starter/Protobuf.pm, fixed stale VERSION/NAME in Base.pm, and brought bin/protobuf-starter POD to parity with module-starter.
    - Fixed LICENSE ('apache_2_0') and added META_MERGE resources in Makefile.PL and generated Makefile_PL_guts for CPAN/Debian lintian compliance.
    - Fixed Base.pm imported google.iam.v1 type resolution, reserved Perl lifecycle method names (import -> import_rpc), duplicate method deduplication, dot/hyphen filename sanitization, and fast cached brace-jump parsing for large schemas (e.g., compute.proto).

0.06    2026-11-22
    - Enhanced top-level schema container POD to include SYNOPSIS, CLIENTS, and SEE ALSO links to generated *Client classes for MetaCPAN/PAUSE discoverability.
    - Defaulted generated Makefile.PL LICENSE metadata to 'apache_2_0' in Module::Starter::Protobuf::Base and bin/protobuf-starter to align with POD and copyright headers.

0.05    2026-11-21
    - Extracted Module::Starter::Protobuf::Base and added compile_types_only mode.
    - Added strict request construction, fail-closed validation for explicit credentials, and REST transport dispatch support.
    - Added google3-aware protoc include path handling, README.md, and updated MANIFEST/MANIFEST.SKIP.

0.04    Tue Jul 28 2026
    - Added SECURITY.md

0.03    2026-07-22
        - Encode source .proto paths into generated POD.
        - Exclude uppercase guts methods from POD coverage.
        - Ensure xt directory is created inside basedir.
        - Improve type resolution with pre-scanning.
        [CLI & Code Generator Enhancements]
        - Added --version flag support to protobuf-starter CLI.
        - Fixed POD directive escaping in generated client wrapper HERE-DOC string templates.
        - Configured automatic Test::Pod::Coverage and Test::Perl::Critic generation for client distributions.

0.02    2026-07-17
        [Code Generation & License Headers]
        - Updated starter templates to automatically append Apache 2.0 copyright headers to all generated client libraries and schema modules.
        - Pruned redundant $VERSION declarations from generated client and schema container templates.

        [Architecture]
        - Upgraded package version to 0.02 (lib/Module/Starter/Protobuf.pm).

0.01    2026-01-01
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

